{title: 127 - Infant Holy, Infant Lowly}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #127 • W ZLOBIE LEZY (POLISH CAROL MELODY) • 8.7.8.7.8.7.7.7}
{lyricist: Polish carol}
{composer: Polish carol melody}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 127}
{meta: tune W ZLOBIE LEZY (POLISH CAROL MELODY)}
{meta: meter 8.7.8.7.8.7.7.7}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Infant holy, [Am]infant [F]lowly,
[Gm/D]For His [C7/Bb]bed acattle [Dm/A]stall;
[Am]Oxen [F/C]lowing, [Am]little [F]knowing
[Gm/D]Christ the [C7/Bb]babe is Lord of [Dm/A]all;
[F]Swift are [Dm/F]winging angels [C]singing,
[Bb]Noels ringing, [Dm]tidings [Gm]bringing,
[F]Christ the [Gm/D]babe [C]is [Dm/A]Lord of [F]all,
[Bb/D]Christ the babe [C7/Bb]isLord of [Bb]all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Flocks were sleeping, [Am]shepherds [F]keeping
[Gm/D]Vigil [C7/Bb]till the morning [Dm/A]new;
[Am]Saw the [F/C]glory, [Am]heard [Gm]the [F]story,
[Gm/D]Tidings [C7/Bb]of the gospel [Dm/A]true;
[F]Thus rejoicing, [Dm/A]free [C/G]from sorrow,
[Bb]Praising voicing [Dm]greet the [Gm]morrow,
[F]Christ the [Gm/D]babe [C]was [Dm/A]born for [F]you,
[Bb/D]Christ the babe [C7/Bb]was born for [Bb]you.
{end_of_verse}
